online\n\nOnline requires a recent heartbeat. Registered devices are not assumed connected.\n\nAlerts\n\nNo device or stock alerts.\n\nRecent orders\nOrder\tBranch\tSource\tStatus\tPayment\tAmount\tBill\nGet Your Restaurant Ready\n\n3 of 4 steps complete\n\nAdd your dishes\nSet up this branch’s tables\nAdd your team\nConnect receipt and kitchen printers\nGuest menu readiness\nCheck again\n\nMenu version 1 is published.\n\nDraft: 100 dishes in 10 categories.\n\n1. Publish your menu. Resolve the errors above, then publish the latest draft.\n2. Confirm terminal delivery. 2 of 2 devices report the current menu. Check device acknowledgements\n3. Open a guest menu. Set up a table QR\n4. Verify staff receive an order. Use a supervised test in your configured test environment. Confirm the correct counter and kitchen receive it. This checklist does not place or pay for an order.\nOpen menu & publish\n\nPublication confirms the server menu. Check a guest QR page or kiosk and place a test order to verify delivery to staff.\n\nBefore your first guest\nYour branch setup checklist\nCheck setup again\n\nA setup check verifies configuration. Place a small test order and confirm staff receive it before opening service.\n\nSelected branch · 7/9 checks passed · Finish the checks below\n\nActive, correctly mapped QR codes\n\nGenerate a QR code for a valid table or menu in Tables & QR.\n\nOpen settings →\nOnline payment readinessOptional\n\nConfigure your merchant integration or turn off online payment.\n\nOpen settings →\nView completed checks (7)\nJAMAN AI",
